
---
import DocsLayout from '/src/layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import DocsCode from '/src/components/DocsCode.astro';
---

<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`AGENT_FLOATING_VIA_SCRIPTED_ATTACHMENT: number = 32768`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer AGENT_FLOATING_VIA_SCRIPTED_ATTACHMENT = 32768;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant AGENT_FLOATING_VIA_SCRIPTED_ATTACHMENT has the value 0x8000</p>
  <p>Indicates that the agent is floating because of a scripted attachment using either <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlSetHoverHeight" target="_blank">llSetHoverHeight</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGroundRepel" target="_blank">llGroundRepel</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>AgentInfo</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>

      <div class="label-stack">
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
  <h2>Caveats</h2>
  <p>Not available until server v2024.11-Apple_Cobbler</p>
  <h2>Related Articles</h2>
  <h3>Functions</h3>
  <table>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>•</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/LlGetAgentInfo" target="_blank">llGetAgentInfo</a></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <h2>Examples</h2>
<div class="lua-block"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`-- This is a code fragment only
if bit32.btest(ll.GetAgentInfo(ll.GetOwner()), AGENT_FLOATING_VIA_SCRIPTED_ATTACHMENT) then
    ll.Say(0, "You're walking on air!")
end`} lang="slua" /></div>
<div class="lsl-block"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`// This is a code fragment only
    if (llGetAgentInfo( llGetOwner() ) & AGENT_FLOATING_VIA_SCRIPTED_ATTACHMENT)    
        llSay(0, "You're walking on air!");`} lang="lsl" /></div>
